#{[17592186485584 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186485408 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485584 #edb/ref 1069 "q-68357" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485584 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485584 #edb/ref 1071 "${2}^{-9}÷{2}^{-5}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485584 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "dade69e9-73ae-574b-b21e-ceb9971eb952" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485584 #edb/ref 1074 "To divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n{2}^{-9}÷{2}^{-5}={2}^{(-9)-(-5)}={2}^{-4}\n$$\n\nTo evaluate ${2}^{-4},$ we find the reciprocal of the base $(2)$ and then raise that reciprocal to the same power but with the opposite sign:\n\n$$\n{2}^{-4}={(\\frac{1}{2})}^{4}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{16}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485591 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186485438 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485591 #edb/ref 1069 "q-68333" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485591 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485591 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\frac{{3}^{2}}{{3}^{-3}}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485591 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f98810bc-183c-5870-9d6b-3edb2448dbd3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485591 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we write the fraction as a division:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{3}^{2}}{{3}^{-3}}={3}^{2}÷{3}^{-3}\n$$\n\nNow, to divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{3}^{2}÷{3}^{-3} & ={3}^{2-(-3)} \\\\  & ={3}^{2+3} \\\\  & ={3}^{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
